  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "Textual warning mapped onto armed individuals",
  "description": "The text 'just because your islamaphobic doesn't mean they don't want to kill you' is juxtaposed with the visual of armed individuals holding RPGs. This creates an analogical mapping where the armed individuals are symbolically mapped as the entities that 'want to kill you' — specifically, Muslims perceived as violent — in response to the viewer's islamophobia. The visual material (armed individuals) is used to represent the perceived threat from Muslims, which the text explicitly links to the viewer's islamophobic stance.",
